  (text "J5: selected3.3V/5V GNSS VCC; nominal3.3V PPS/UART. J2: read-only PPS/TX, no power.\nJP9 and JP10 must move together: 2-3 BUFFER default, 1-2 DIRECT comparison.\nJP11 normally OPEN: never load boot-shared GNSS PPS without receiver qualification."
